{"content_hash": "679d08dc4cb88c26", "version_id": 675, "article_id": 68, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Halpin's two-run homer lifts Guardians over Rays for 2-1 ALCS lead", "title_zh": "霍尔平两分炮助守护者击败光芒，美联冠军赛2-1领先", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "guardian_sport", "source_url": "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2026/oct/15/guardians-rays-alcs-game-3-petey-halpin-home-run", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1718653070244-e9356b63605b?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OXx8cGV0ZXklMjBoYWxwaW4lMjB0d298ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MjEwODA0Mnww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Paulo Cristovam on Unsplash", "author": "Paulo Cristovam", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@paulera96?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-man-standing-next-to-another-man-holding-a-microphone-a2w2QJguYGc?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(313, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(351, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "14e97573966c"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-16", "word_count": 254, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "Petey Halpin's go-ahead two-run homer in the fifth inning powered Cleveland to a 3-2 win over Tampa Bay in Game 3 of the ALCS on Thursday. The Guardians now lead the best-of-seven series 2-1, with Game 4 scheduled for Friday despite a rainy forecast.", "lead_zh": "周四，佩蒂·霍尔平在第五局轰出超前两分全垒打，帮助克利夫兰以3-2击败坦帕湾，赢得美联冠军赛第三战。守护者目前在七战四胜系列赛中以2-1领先，第四战定于周五举行，但天气预报有雨。", "preview": "Halpin's first career postseason home run, a 385-foot drive off an elevated 95.9 mph sinker from Griffin Jax, came after Patrick Bailey reac", "preview_zh": "霍尔平职业生涯首个季后赛全垒打，是一记385英尺的深远打击，面对格里芬·贾克斯投出的95.9英里/小时偏高伸卡球。此前帕特里克·贝利靠一记贾克斯未能干净处理的触击球上垒。这记全垒打让克利夫兰以3-2领先，也是贾克斯自9月9日以来首次被轰出全垒打。何塞·拉米雷斯贡献两支安打，纳撒尼", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 663, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/68/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 94.425, "size_bytes": 567504, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 297, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/68/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 97.075, "size_bytes": 583344, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 297, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/68/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/68/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 104.05, "size_bytes": 625248, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 297, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/68/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/68/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 89.55, "size_bytes": 538272, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 297, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/68/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/68/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 96.975, "size_bytes": 582768, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 297, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/68/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@e692d12/content/data/versions/675.json", "paragraphs": ["Halpin's first career postseason home run, a 385-foot drive off an elevated 95.9 mph sinker from Griffin Jax, came after Patrick Bailey reached on a chopper that Jax failed to field cleanly. The blast gave Cleveland a 3-2 lead and handed Jax his first home run allowed since September 9. José Ramírez contributed two hits, while Nathaniel Lowe added an RBI double in the second to open the scoring.", "Gavin Williams delivered a solid outing, striking out nine over five innings while allowing two runs on one walk. He improved to 2-0 with a 2.16 ERA and 33 strikeouts across 16 and two-thirds postseason innings this year. Chandler Simpson had briefly put Tampa Bay ahead with a two-run triple in the fourth, but the Rays' offense stalled thereafter.", "Cleveland's bullpen was nearly flawless, retiring 16 of the Rays' final 17 batters. Daniel Espino, Erik Sabrowski, Hunter Gaddis and Cade Smith combined to permit just one baserunner over the last four innings. Cade Smith escaped a jam in the eighth by striking out Yandy Díaz after a 10-pitch battle, then retired the side in order in the ninth to seal the victory.", "Tampa Bay's struggles at the plate were stark: the team went down in order in seven innings, with Junior Caminero striking out four times. Rays batters fanned 13 times in Game 3, bringing their series total to 27. The Guardians, meanwhile, have now won five of their last six playoff games since trailing the Chicago White Sox 2-0 in the AL Division Series."], "paragraphs_zh": ["霍尔平职业生涯首个季后赛全垒打，是一记385英尺的深远打击，面对格里芬·贾克斯投出的95.9英里/小时偏高伸卡球。此前帕特里克·贝利靠一记贾克斯未能干净处理的触击球上垒。这记全垒打让克利夫兰以3-2领先，也是贾克斯自9月9日以来首次被轰出全垒打。何塞·拉米雷斯贡献两支安打，纳撒尼尔·洛在第二局追加一支二垒安打首开纪录。", "加文·威廉姆斯表现稳健，主投五局送出九次三振，仅因一次保送丢掉两分。他今年季后赛四次登板（三次先发）战绩提升至2胜0负，防御率2.16，在16又三分之二局中投出33次三振。钱德勒·辛普森曾在第四局用一支两分三垒安打短暂为坦帕湾取得领先，但此后光芒进攻哑火。", "克利夫兰牛棚几乎无懈可击，让光芒最后17名打者中的16人出局。丹尼尔·埃斯皮诺、埃里克·萨布罗夫斯基、亨特·加迪斯和凯德·史密斯在最后四局联手仅让一名跑者上垒。凯德·史密斯在第八局经过10球缠斗三振扬迪·迪亚兹化解危机，随后在第九局三上三下锁定胜局。", "坦帕湾在打击端的挣扎十分明显：全场有七局三上三下，朱尼尔·卡米内罗一人就吞下四次三振。光芒打者在第三战被三振13次，系列赛总数达到27次。与此同时，守护者自美联分区系列赛0-2落后芝加哥白袜以来，最近六场季后赛已赢下五场。"], "body": "Halpin's first career postseason home run, a 385-foot drive off an elevated 95.9 mph sinker from Griffin Jax, came after Patrick Bailey reached on a chopper that Jax failed to field cleanly. The blast gave Cleveland a 3-2 lead and handed Jax his first home run allowed since September 9. José Ramírez contributed two hits, while Nathaniel Lowe added an RBI double in the second to open the scoring.\n\nGavin Williams delivered a solid outing, striking out nine over five innings while allowing two runs on one walk. He improved to 2-0 with a 2.16 ERA and 33 strikeouts across 16 and two-thirds postseason innings this year. Chandler Simpson had briefly put Tampa Bay ahead with a two-run triple in the fourth, but the Rays' offense stalled thereafter.\n\nCleveland's bullpen was nearly flawless, retiring 16 of the Rays' final 17 batters. Daniel Espino, Erik Sabrowski, Hunter Gaddis and Cade Smith combined to permit just one baserunner over the last four innings. Cade Smith escaped a jam in the eighth by striking out Yandy Díaz after a 10-pitch battle, then retired the side in order in the ninth to seal the victory.\n\nTampa Bay's struggles at the plate were stark: the team went down in order in seven innings, with Junior Caminero striking out four times. Rays batters fanned 13 times in Game 3, bringing their series total to 27. The Guardians, meanwhile, have now won five of their last six playoff games since trailing the Chicago White Sox 2-0 in the AL Division Series.", "body_zh": "霍尔平职业生涯首个季后赛全垒打，是一记385英尺的深远打击，面对格里芬·贾克斯投出的95.9英里/小时偏高伸卡球。此前帕特里克·贝利靠一记贾克斯未能干净处理的触击球上垒。这记全垒打让克利夫兰以3-2领先，也是贾克斯自9月9日以来首次被轰出全垒打。何塞·拉米雷斯贡献两支安打，纳撒尼尔·洛在第二局追加一支二垒安打首开纪录。\n\n加文·威廉姆斯表现稳健，主投五局送出九次三振，仅因一次保送丢掉两分。他今年季后赛四次登板（三次先发）战绩提升至2胜0负，防御率2.16，在16又三分之二局中投出33次三振。钱德勒·辛普森曾在第四局用一支两分三垒安打短暂为坦帕湾取得领先，但此后光芒进攻哑火。\n\n克利夫兰牛棚几乎无懈可击，让光芒最后17名打者中的16人出局。丹尼尔·埃斯皮诺、埃里克·萨布罗夫斯基、亨特·加迪斯和凯德·史密斯在最后四局联手仅让一名跑者上垒。凯德·史密斯在第八局经过10球缠斗三振扬迪·迪亚兹化解危机，随后在第九局三上三下锁定胜局。\n\n坦帕湾在打击端的挣扎十分明显：全场有七局三上三下，朱尼尔·卡米内罗一人就吞下四次三振。光芒打者在第三战被三振13次，系列赛总数达到27次。与此同时，守护者自美联分区系列赛0-2落后芝加哥白袜以来，最近六场季后赛已赢下五场。", "text": "Halpin's first career postseason home run, a 385-foot drive off an elevated 95.9 mph sinker from Griffin Jax, came after Patrick Bailey reached on a chopper that Jax failed to field cleanly. The blast gave Cleveland a 3-2 lead and handed Jax his first home run allowed since September 9. José Ramírez contributed two hits, while Nathaniel Lowe added an RBI double in the second to open the scoring. Gavin Williams delivered a solid outing, striking out nine over five innings while allowing two runs on one walk. He improved to 2-0 with a 2.16 ERA and 33 strikeouts across 16 and two-thirds postseason innings this year. Chandler Simpson had briefly put Tampa Bay ahead with a two-run triple in the fourth, but the Rays' offense stalled thereafter. Cleveland's bullpen was nearly flawless, retiring 16 of the Rays' final 17 batters. Daniel Espino, Erik Sabrowski, Hunter Gaddis and Cade Smith combined to permit just one baserunner over the last four innings. Cade Smith escaped a jam in the eighth by striking out Yandy Díaz after a 10-pitch battle, then retired the side in order in the ninth to seal the victory. Tampa Bay's struggles at the plate were stark: the team went down in order in seven innings, with Junior Caminero striking out four times. Rays batters fanned 13 times in Game 3, bringing their series total to 27. The Guardians, meanwhile, have now won five of their last six playoff games since trailing the Chicago White Sox 2-0 in the AL Division Series.", "vocab": [{"word": "go-ahead", "pos": "adj", "zh": "超前的，反超的", "note": "常用于体育报道，如 go-ahead goal/home run", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "homer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "全垒打", "note": "home run 的口语缩写", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sinker", "pos": "noun", "zh": "伸卡球", "note": "棒球球种，下坠速度快", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "postseason", "pos": "noun/adj", "zh": "季后赛", "note": "同 playoffs，常作定语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "bullpen", "pos": "noun", "zh": "牛棚（后援投手群）", "note": "指替补投手整体", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "retire", "pos": "verb", "zh": "使出局", "note": "棒球中让打者出局", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "baserunner", "pos": "noun", "zh": "跑垒员", "note": "上垒的进攻球员", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "strand", "pos": "verb", "zh": "使（跑者）残垒", "note": "strand a runner 让跑者留在垒上出局", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "strike out", "pos": "verb", "zh": "三振出局", "note": "名词形式 strikeout", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fan", "pos": "verb", "zh": "三振", "note": "口语，指击球员挥空被三振", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "RBI", "pos": "noun", "zh": "打点", "note": "run batted in 的缩写", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ERA", "pos": "noun", "zh": "防御率", "note": "earned run average 的缩写", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "inning", "pos": "noun", "zh": "局", "note": "棒球比赛的基本单位", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "best-of-seven", "pos": "adj", "zh": "七战四胜制的", "note": "描述系列赛赛制", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Petey Halpin’s two-run homer lifts Guardians past Rays for 2-1 ALCS lead", "summary_original": "Halpin’s first playoff homer puts Cleveland ahead\nWilliams strikes out nine as Guardians win 3-2\nCleveland bullpen retires 11 of final 12 Rays batters\nPetey Halpin hit a go-ahead two-run homer, Gavin Williams struck out nine over five innings and the Cleveland Guardians beat the Tampa Bay Rays 3-2 in Game 3 of the American League Championship Series on Thursday to take a 2-1 lead.\nGame 4 of the best-of-seven series is scheduled for Friday, though rain is forecast.\nContinue reading...", "body_original": "Petey Halpin’s two-run homer lifts Guardians past Rays for 2-1 ALCS lead\nHalpin’s first playoff homer puts Cleveland ahead\nWilliams strikes out nine as Guardians win 3-2\nCleveland bullpen retires 11 of final 12 Rays batters\nPetey Halpin hit a go-ahead two-run homer, Gavin Williams struck out nine over five innings and the\nCleveland Guardians\nbeat the Tampa Bay Rays 3-2 in Game 3 of the American League Championship Series on Thursday to take a 2-1 lead.\nGame 4 of the best-of-seven series is scheduled for Friday, though rain is forecast.\nJosé Ramírez had two hits and Nathaniel Lowe added an RBI for the Guardians, who have won five of their last six playoff games since falling 2-0 behind the Chicago White Sox in their AL Division Series.\nWilliams allowed two runs over five innings while walking one. He is 2-0 with a 2.16 ERA and 33 strikeouts over 16 and two-thirds innings innings in four postseason appearances this year, including three starts.\nCleveland retired 16 of the Rays’ final 17 batters. Daniel Espino, Erik Sabrowski, Hunter Gaddis and Cade Smith combined to allow just one baserunner over the final four innings.\nSmith stranded a runner at third in the eighth when he struck out Yandy Díaz after a 10-pitch at-bat, then retired the side in order in the ninth.\nTampa Bay went down in order in seven innings, with Junior Caminero striking out four times. Rays batters struck out 13 times in Game 3 after combining for 14 in the first two games of the series.\nLowe opened the scoring with an RBI double in the second that bounced off the right-field fence and past Victor Mesa Jr.\nChandler Simpson put the Rays ahead with a two-run triple in the fourth.\nPatrick Bailey led off the fifth with a chopper that pitcher Griffin Jax was unable to field cleanly. Halpin then connected on an elevated 95.9mph sinker on a 2-2 count, driving it 385ft into the right-center-field stands to give Cleveland a 3-2 lead.\nIt was Halpin’s first postseason home run and only the fifth of his two-year major league career. Jax had not allowed a homer since 9 September, a span of five appearances.\nWilliams did not allow a baserunner and struck out five the first time through the order.\nJax allowed three runs on five hits and two walks in four-plus innings.\nExplore more on these topics\nMLB\nCleveland Guardians\nTampa Bay Rays\nBaseball\nUS sports\nShare\nReuse this content", "fetched_at": "2026-10-15T23:47:20.173050", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Halpin's", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.762, "sm": 275, "em": 762, "cs": 0, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "first", "s": 0.762, "e": 1.125, "sm": 762, "em": 1125, "cs": 9, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "career", "s": 1.125, "e": 1.475, "sm": 1125, "em": 14